// Phase 13 — DevTools: why-changed, graph stats, timeline steps
// Build: luke BUILD examples/build/reactive_conformance_devtools.luke -o build/ex_rx_conf_devtools

REMEMBER price AS 10
REMEMBER qty AS 2
THE total IS price MULTIPLIED BY qty

CHANGE price TO 20

SPEAK "write=" AND THE LAST WRITE ID
SPEAK "root=" AND THE WHY ROOT OF total
SPEAK "depth=" AND THE WHY DEPTH OF total
SPEAK "deps=" AND THE DEP COUNT OF total
SPEAK "subs=" AND THE SUB COUNT OF price
SPEAK "cells=" AND THE GRAPH CELL COUNT
SPEAK "derived=" AND THE GRAPH DERIVED COUNT
SPEAK "edges=" AND THE GRAPH EDGE COUNT
SPEAK "step0=" AND THE TIMELINE STEP ID AT 0
SPEAK "wave0=" AND THE TIMELINE STEP WAVE AT 0
TRACE WHY total
SPEAK "traces=" AND THE WHY TRACE COUNT
DUMP REACTIVE GRAPH
SPEAK "dumps=" AND THE GRAPH DUMP COUNT
